  "description": "AI add-ons for the Shiny Blazor CameraView. Document scanning: detects that a document is present in a frame in-browser (no OCR), then sends just that one cropped frame to a Microsoft.Extensions.AI IChatClient for structured data extraction — so the model only runs on real documents, not every frame. Photo stylization: redraws a captured still through a Microsoft.Extensions.AI IImageGenerator (comic, watercolour, pixel art, …) as a capture effect. Provider-agnostic, and strongly typed via MEAI structured output.",
